Z||000000||Tryxalon||04-01-2001||09:55 PM||||On either side of the car is a rubber mat or curtain like rig on both sides extending down about 4 inches past the inner fender. <P>It doesn't appear that it is there to extend the inner wheel well and protect the engine compartment from dirt, mud, etc because the wheels would not "throw stuff" that direction. (it would throw it back!) <P>What are they supposed to accomplish?? <P> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||04-02-2001||12:15 AM||||Well, they protect the engine compartment from dirt and mud and block off the openings for looks.||||reg||1
